    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d548">

                <pb facs="0717" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.6176/4–1045: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Berle</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-04-18T13:00:00-04:00">April 18, 1945—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>991. ReEmbs 1112, April 10. Department, RDC<anchor n="73" xml:id="d548-f1"/> and
                    other interested agencies are now considering in detail possible arrangements
                    for the inclusion of Argentina within the control and quota system covering
                    rubber products, rubber substitutes and rubber. Please assure the Foreign
                        Minister<anchor n="74" xml:id="d548-f2"/> that we are giving prompt and
                    earnest attention to this problem, that we believe that an overall solution to
                    the numerous questions involved, even if it may require a 2- or 3-week delay, is
                    more desirable than an immediate partial solution, and that we firmly intend to
                    discuss in advance with Brazil any procedure suggested before discussions are
                    initiated with Argentina, to the end that such procedure may be correlated with
                    quota and control plans now in existence.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d548-f1" n="73" xml:id="d548-f1-content">
                <p>Rubber Development Corporation.</p>
            </note>
